# 1. Introduction

This project is a modern frontend web application developed using React JS, Vite, and TailwindCSS. The system was designed to provide a fast, responsive, and attractive user interface.

The project also uses Git and GitHub for version control and repository management.

---

# 2. Objectives

## General Objective

To develop and manage a modern frontend web application professionally using Git and GitHub.

## Specific Objectives

* Create a responsive frontend application
* Use TailwindCSS for styling
* Manage project versions using Git
* Push project to GitHub
* Pull updates from repository
* Organize project files professionally

